        "$id": "87",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "1. Setup / Jira Data Center\nSet JiraBaseUrl (include /jira if used), ProjectKey and Username. Enter Password in the protected input field; it stays local. HTTP Basic Auth must be enabled by your Jira administrator. Use HTTPS. There is no separate login/token call. This example targets the Jira Data Center REST API v2, not Confluence or Jira Cloud.",
        "OverriddenNotificationEntries": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.ObservableCollection`1[[FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.Base.OverriddenNotificationEntry, FlowBlox.Core]], System.ObjectModel",
