      {
        "$id": "89",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "3. Discover installation-specific field IDs\nGET /api/2/field finds the Sprint field via its schema.custom type and Story Points by common display names. JSON_ResolveCustomFields selects one ID per field. If your Story Points field has a different localized/custom name, adapt its JPath filter. Missing custom fields and unset estimates remain blank; ticket rows stay aligned.",
