      {
        "$id": "90",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "4. Complete, read-only REST retrieval\nThe public Atlassian Jira Data Center OpenAPI definition supplies the endpoints. Its .v3.json suffix describes the OpenAPI format, not Jira REST v3. The actual route is /rest/api/2/search. maxResults=100 is a request; Jira may return fewer. Offset advances by received item count until total is reached. A failed page or page limit aborts without exporting partial rows.",
        "OverriddenNotificationEntries": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.ObservableCollection`1[[FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.Base.OverriddenNotificationEntry, FlowBlox.Core]], System.ObjectModel",
